OL,3,GNEWSAFace-to-face with the fraudsters
OL,4,Awho took my money
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was a day Jane Bertelli did not want
OL,7,Fto miss - she was heading for Southwark
OL,8,FCrown Court.
OL,10,FEver since the men who took #12,000,
OL,11,Fleft to her by an elderly relative,
OL,12,Fadmitted fraud, she had wanted to look
OL,13,Fthem in the eyes.
OL,15,FSqueezed into a standard class seat on
OL,16,Fa busy commuter train, her mode of
OL,17,Ftransport was a world away from the
OL,18,Fthree men who took her money, and that
OL,19,Fof 3,000 other people.
